DTSTAMP:20261009T204919Z
DTSTART:20260916T081500
DTEND:20260916T093000
SUMMARY:Senior School Talk Program - Females NEW to SSA
DESCRIPTION:All female students new to SSA should attend this Talk session.  Talk's school based model was developed and refined at Carnegie Mellon University's Institute for Social Innovation in 2010. During the program's development\, Talk creators examined every approach to sex education curriculum that had a positive impact on teenagers. Then they interviewed parents and high school students from across the country to figure out what was missing. Talk's school based program leverages best practices while addressing the pitfalls and limitations of existing approaches.
LOCATION:Hillman Center - HCPA Kountz Theater
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
