DTEND:20261006T093000
SUMMARY:Parent Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Director of the Library\, Lindsey Myers\, will lead a discussion on the book The Correspondent by Virginia Evans - a touching novel about the power of the written word and connection with others that promises thoughtful conversation and our own community connection. All parents are welcome\, whether you are new to the group or a returning participant and whether you have read the book or not. For more information\, contact Co-chairs Kirsten Marcel at kmarcel99@sbcglobal.net or Veronica Dristas at dristas@pitt.edu.
LOCATION:Upper School Campus - SS Memorial Library
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
