SUMMARY:UPA Haunted Walk
DESCRIPTION:Take a family-friendly trick-or-treat walk along a ¾-mile wooded trail filled with spooky surprises before ending the evening with a bonfire and refreshments. Parent volunteers transform the trail with handcrafted displays and staff the treat stops\, while student volunteers in Grade 7 and above join the fun as costumed haunters. For an extra thrill\, children in Grade 4 and above can brave the optional scare loop.
LOCATION:Athletic Fac.\, Far Fields - McKnight Center Upper Level\, SSA Gene Deal Fields\, SSA Lower Tennis Courts\, SSA McKnight Hockey Center\, SSA Riding Meadow Far Fields - Center\, SSA Riding Meadow Far Fields
PRIORITY:0
