DTEND:20261209T133000
SUMMARY:Shady Side Academy Blood Drive
DESCRIPTION:All are invited to donate blood at the first Senior School Blood Drive of the year\, hosted by the PreMed Club.  The drive is scheduled for Wednesday\, December 9th in the Benedum Student Center from 9AM - 2PM.  Students when they donate can earn prizes such as Pajamas\, Air Pods\, etc.  All Registered Donors will be entered into a drawing to Win (1) of (3)  $10\,000 Gift Cards.  To register\, use this link https://donors.vitalant.org/dwp/portal/dwa/appointment/guest/phl/timeSlotsExtr?token=h%2FONni2wl3EhCnk8H2jXM%2BLmvcI%2BRU5Z18Em%2B1SYX2s%3D or schedule directly with Mr. Greg Weiss.
