DTEND:20270130T133000
SUMMARY:Goldstein Test Prep - Practice Tests
DESCRIPTION:Shady Side students will have the opportunity to take a free SAT and/or ACT practice test through Goldstein Test Prep. Students are welcome to try an SAT and an ACT in consecutive weekends to determine which might be the better fit. Tests are free to attend\, but please reserve a spot by registering with Mike Goldstein at ?mike.goldstein@goldsteintestprep.com ?or calling 412-874-7645.
LOCATION:Upper School Campus - SS Rowe 201\, SS Rowe 202
