UID:129847593@www.shadysideacademy.org
DTSTAMP:20261009T204919Z
DTSTART:20270204T100000
DTEND:20270204T103000
SUMMARY:Personal Finance Class Session
DESCRIPTION:At Shady Side\, learning is meant to have real-world impact and value. This Personal Finance course is designed with that in mind. Students will engage with practical topics such as managing money\, understanding credit\, and making informed financial decisions. The goal is not only knowledge\, but confidence and judgment in real situations they will soon encounter.  All students will complete a Personal Finance course as part of graduation requirements during their tenth grade year. This aligns with new mandated requirements across Pennsylvania and reflects Shady Side's continued focus on preparing students for life beyond the classroom.
LOCATION:Hillman Center - HCPA Kountz Theater
PRIORITY:0
END:VEVENT
