DESCRIPTION:Hosted by SSA partner\, College Money Method\, this workshop and resources give you the tools to evaluate how generous colleges will be with their need-based and merit-based aid and to calculate your expected awards and costs. You'll have an understanding your financial commitments to the colleges on your list before you apply. (Register here: https://tinyurl.com/yc46fd73)
